      "created_at": "2022-09-25T14:14:06.159Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/counting-the-multiverse/18685\">This thread</a> lists the full card count, but if you want them enumerated…</p>\n<p>Aw heck, gimme a minute.</p>\n<p><strong>HEROES</strong> (37 x 40 card decks)<br>\nAbsolute Zero<br>\nAkash’Thriya<br>\nArgent Adept<br>\nBenchmark<br>\nBunker<br>\nCaptain Cosmic<br>\nChrono-Ranger<br>\nDr. Medico<br>\nExpatriette<br>\nFanatic<br>\nGuise<br>\nHaka<br>\nThe Harpy<br>\nThe Idealist<br>\nK.N.Y.F.E.<br>\nLa Comodora<br>\nLegacy<br>\nLifeline<br>\nLuminary<br>\nMainstay<br>\nMister Fixer<br>\nNaturalist<br>\nNightmist<br>\nOmnitron-X<br>\nParse<br>\nRa<br>\nThe Scholar<br>\nThe Sentinels<br>\nSetback<br>\nSky-Scraper<br>\nStuntman<br>\nTachyon<br>\nTempest<br>\nUnity<br>\nVisionary<br>\nThe Wraith<br>\nWrithe</p>\n<p><strong>SOLO VILLAINS</strong> (24 x 25 card decks + 2)<br>\nAkash’Bhuta<br>\nAmbuscade<br>\nApostate<br>\nBaron Blade<br>\nThe Chairman<br>\nChokepoint<br>\nCitizen Dawn<br>\nDeadline<br>\nThe Dreamer<br>\nThe Ennead<br>\nGloomweaver<br>\nGrand Warlord Voss<br>\nInfinitor<br>\nIron Legacy<br>\nKaargra Warfang (15 card villain deck + 10 card Title deck + Bloodsworn Coliseum and The Crowd’s Favor)<br>\nKismet<br>\nLa Capitan<br>\nThe Matriarch<br>\nMiss Information<br>\nOmnitron<br>\nPlague Rat<br>\nProgeny<br>\nSpite<br>\nWager Master</p>\n<p><strong>ENVIRONMENTS</strong> (27 x 15 card decks)<br>\nThe Block<br>\nCelestial Tribunal<br>\nChampion Studios<br>\nThe Court of Blood<br>\nDok’Thorath Capital<br>\nThe Enclave of the Endlings<br>\nFort Adamant<br>\nThe Final Wasteland<br>\nFreedom Tower<br>\nInsula Primalis<br>\nMadame Mittermeier’s Fantastical Festival of Conundrums and Curiosities<br>\nThe Maerynian Refuge<br>\nMagmaria<br>\nMegalopolis<br>\nThe Mobile Defense Platform<br>\nMordengrad<br>\nThe Nexus of the Void<br>\nOmnitron IV<br>\nPike Industrial Plant<br>\nThe Realm of Discord<br>\nRook City<br>\nThe Ruins of Atlantis<br>\nSilver Gulch, 1883<br>\nThe Temple of Zhu Long<br>\nThe Time Cataclysm<br>\nThe Tomb of Anubis<br>\nWagner Mars Base</p>\n<p><strong>TEAM VILLAINS</strong> (15 x 20 card decks)<br>\nAmbuscade<br>\nBaron Blade<br>\nBiomancer<br>\nBugbear<br>\nCitizens Hammer &amp; Anvil<br>\nErmine<br>\nFriction<br>\nFright Train<br>\nGreazer<br>\nLa Capitan<br>\nMiss Information<br>\nThe Operative<br>\nPlague Rat<br>\nProletariat<br>\nSergeant Steel</p>\n<p><strong>OBLIVAEON DECKS</strong> (varies)<br>\nOblivaeon deck - 25 cards<br>\nAeon Men deck - 25 cards<br>\nScion deck - 25 cards<br>\nMission deck - 25 cards<br>\nShield deck - 5 cards</p>",
