      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[This thread](https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/counting-the-multiverse/18685) lists the full card count, but if you want them enumerated...\n\nAw heck, gimme a minute.\n\n**HEROES** (37 x 40 card decks)\nAbsolute Zero\nAkash'Thriya\nArgent Adept\nBenchmark\nBunker\nCaptain Cosmic\nChrono-Ranger\nDr. Medico\nExpatriette\nFanatic\nGuise\nHaka\nThe Harpy\nThe Idealist\nK.N.Y.F.E.\nLa Comodora\nLegacy\nLifeline\nLuminary\nMainstay\nMister Fixer\nNaturalist\nNightmist\nOmnitron-X\nParse\nRa\nThe Scholar\nThe Sentinels\nSetback\nSky-Scraper\nStuntman\nTachyon\nTempest\nUnity\nVisionary\nThe Wraith\nWrithe\n\n**SOLO VILLAINS** (24 x 25 card decks + 2)\nAkash'Bhuta\nAmbuscade\nApostate\nBaron Blade\nThe Chairman\nChokepoint\nCitizen Dawn\nDeadline\nThe Dreamer\nThe Ennead\nGloomweaver\nGrand Warlord Voss\nInfinitor\nIron Legacy\nKaargra Warfang (15 card villain deck + 10 card Title deck + Bloodsworn Coliseum and The Crowd's Favor)\nKismet\nLa Capitan\nThe Matriarch\nMiss Information\nOmnitron\nPlague Rat\nProgeny\nSpite\nWager Master\n\n**ENVIRONMENTS** (27 x 15 card decks)\nThe Block\nCelestial Tribunal\nChampion Studios\nThe Court of Blood\nDok'Thorath Capital\nThe Enclave of the Endlings\nFort Adamant\nThe Final Wasteland\nFreedom Tower\nInsula Primalis\nMadame Mittermeier's Fantastical Festival of Conundrums and Curiosities\nThe Maerynian Refuge\nMagmaria\nMegalopolis\nThe Mobile Defense Platform\nMordengrad\nThe Nexus of the Void\nOmnitron IV\nPike Industrial Plant\nThe Realm of Discord\nRook City\nThe Ruins of Atlantis\nSilver Gulch, 1883\nThe Temple of Zhu Long\nThe Time Cataclysm\nThe Tomb of Anubis\nWagner Mars Base\n\n**TEAM VILLAINS** (15 x 20 card decks)\nAmbuscade\nBaron Blade\nBiomancer\nBugbear\nCitizens Hammer & Anvil\nErmine\nFriction\nFright Train\nGreazer\nLa Capitan\nMiss Information\nThe Operative\nPlague Rat\nProletariat\nSergeant Steel\n\n**OBLIVAEON DECKS** (varies)\nOblivaeon deck - 25 cards\nAeon Men deck - 25 cards\nScion deck - 25 cards\nMission deck - 25 cards\nShield deck - 5 cards",
